note The handler. Records the path and step and makes the step the target added steps hang under, unfolds every folded ancestor so the step is visible, then points file, lines and focus at the step. A step whose symbol resolves focuses that symbol; a bare line slice focuses the symbol enclosing its first line. Scrolling::Scroll leaves a ticketed request that the document answers once the header is laid out.

